  "details": "This would allow modders to add very niche features to the game so the developers don't have to. Obviously there would be limitations and the need for mods to be verified (or make it be a trust system, verified mods are allowed in public instances and untrusted mods aren't)\nA few examples of niche mods that could be implemented with this system: Leap Motion Controller support, Kinect for FBT, and a Program launcher.\nModding communities tend to keep a game alive, VRCTeam please keep our platform alive and consider what I have suggested",
